   "text": "Self-hosted team secrets manager. Express 5 + PostgreSQL 16 + React SPA. Server-side envelope encryption (AES-256-GCM) rooted in an ejson keypair. Sections: A system architecture, B key hierarchy, C data model, D\nflows 1-10, E RBAC, F audit chain, G threat model.",
   "originalText": "Self-hosted team secrets manager. Express 5 + PostgreSQL 16 + React SPA. Server-side envelope encryption (AES-256-GCM) rooted in an ejson keypair. Sections: A system architecture, B key hierarchy, C data model, D\nflows 1-10, E RBAC, F audit chain, G threat model.",
   "fontSize": 20,
