   "text": "PostgreSQL 16 via Prisma\nusers · passkeys · totp_secrets (encrypted) ·\nrecovery_codes (argon2id) · invites (sha256) · projects\n· environments (wrapped DEK) · environment_members ·\nsecrets · secret_versions (AES-GCM ciphertext) ·\nservice_tokens (sha256) · access_requests · audit_log\n(INSERT-only trigger + hash chain) · session",
   "originalText": "PostgreSQL 16 via Prisma\nusers · passkeys · totp_secrets (encrypted) ·\nrecovery_codes (argon2id) · invites (sha256) · projects\n· environments (wrapped DEK) · environment_members ·\nsecrets · secret_versions (AES-GCM ciphertext) ·\nservice_tokens (sha256) · access_requests · audit_log\n(INSERT-only trigger + hash chain) · session",
