  {
   "id": "text-0369",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2645,
   "y": 4414.0,
   "width": 1171,
   "height": 118,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": "fram-0687",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1103487120,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 752422902,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1760000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "• Non-member → 404 (environments cannot be enumerated)\n• Admin self-grant allowed but audited (member.admin_self_grant) and owners alerted\n• Protected env (prod by default): editors confirm each change with the env slug; viewers need recent MFA to reveal; others\n   file an AccessRequest for time-boxed access\n• The last owner of an environment cannot be removed\n• Service tokens: scope read → JSON / ejson pull; scope export → ejson only",
   "originalText": "• Non-member → 404 (environments cannot be enumerated)\n• Admin self-grant allowed but audited (member.admin_self_grant) and owners alerted\n• Protected env (prod by default): editors confirm each change with the env slug; viewers need recent MFA to reveal; others\n   file an AccessRequest for time-boxed access\n• The last owner of an environment cannot be removed\n• Service tokens: scope read → JSON / ejson pull; scope export → ejson only",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "rect-0368",
   "lineHeight": 1.15,
   "autoResize": true,
   "customData": {
    "section": "E"
   }
  },
