   "text": "3. Server decrypts values with the\nDEK in memory, encrypts each to\nthe recipient (ephemeral keypair,\nfresh nonce). The server cannot\nread the result.",
   "originalText": "3. Server decrypts values with the\nDEK in memory, encrypts each to\nthe recipient (ephemeral keypair,\nfresh nonce). The server cannot\nread the result.",
